@startuml Vista de Processos – Level 2 (US 2.2.8 – Submit Vessel Visit Notification)
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor Black
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    LifeLineBorderColor Black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantBorderColor Black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

participant "<<container (C4)>>\nSPA (Web UI)" as UI #87CEEB
participant "<<container (C4)>>\nPort Logistics (Backend)" as BACKEND #87CEEB

-> UI: 1: asks to submit a VVN
activate UI
UI --> : 1.1: shows active VVN and asks to select one
deactivate UI
-> UI: 2: selects VVN and requests submission
activate UI
UI -> BACKEND: 2.1: submit selected VVN (vvnId)
activate BACKEND
BACKEND --> UI: 2.1.1: marked as "submitted" and Port Authority Officer notified
UI --> : 2.2: submission confirmation
deactivate BACKEND
deactivate UI

@enduml